# Hub UI

Reuse `BrandLockup`, `ActionBtn`, `Field`, `Modal`, workspace tabs. Do not add a second logo or gold metallic chrome. Linen `#f4f0ea`, ink `#1f2930`, teal `#0f6e6b` on **actions only**.

Hub + invoices + finance: Arabic RTL. Designer: English chrome, Arabic names as stored.

# Responsive

- Fluid layout. No 1440px traps, no `overflow: hidden` on the page shell.
- Inputs `16px` / `min-height: 2.75rem`. Tap targets ≥ 44px. `viewportFit: cover` + safe-area padding.
- Tool tabs scroll horizontally on phone (`bb-tabstrip`). Switching tabs scrolls the window to top (`useWorkspaceTab`).
- **Modals portal to `document.body`**. `.bb-glass` `backdrop-filter` makes `position: fixed` stick to the panel (customer window sat at the bottom). Center on `sm+`; start near the top on phone.

# Consistency

- Filled buttons: teal, hover teal/white. `.bb-btn.bb-glass` and `data-tone="ghost"` keep **dark text** on hover.
- Paid / pending: green vs amber chips — also keep the words مدفوعة / معلقة.
- `prefers-reduced-transparency`: solid panels. Print is high-contrast, separate from hub chrome.
